# Sleep-Cursed Faerie, "ward {2}" (CR 702.21a): the positive control. Bot2's Black Lotus makes three red, so after the Bolt it can pay {2}, the ward
# trigger's counter is paid off and the Bolt deals 3 damage to the 3/3 Faerie, which dies.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Sleep-Cursed Faerie
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sleep-Cursed Faerie.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Sleep-Cursed Faerie)
Bot2.PayCost
? Bot2.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sleep-Cursed Faerie = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard = Sleep-Cursed Faerie
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Black Lotus
